/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer

# The two Cross-Origin-* lines make SharedArrayBuffer available. The video
# export currently uses the single-threaded ffmpeg core, which does not need
# them (see DEPLOY.md). They are kept for a possible return to the
# multi-threaded core.
#
# They also mean every cross-origin file has to be fetched with CORS. That is
# already handled in the page: the Google Fonts stylesheet and the JSZip script
# both carry crossorigin, and the ffmpeg core is fetched with fetch() and turned
# into a blob URL.
